sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant AURIS as AURIS System
    participant Safety as Safety Check
    participant RAG as RAG Retrieval
    participant Screening as Screening Loop
    participant Snapshot as Snapshot Generator

    User->>AURIS: Send message
    AURIS->>Safety: Run safety screen

    alt Crisis detected
        Safety-->>User: Crisis resources (988 / 741741 / 911)
        note left of User: Conversation paused until safe
    else Safe to proceed
        AURIS-->>User: RAPPORT greeting and consent
        User->>AURIS: Share concerns
        AURIS->>RAG: Select top scales via retrieval
        RAG-->>AURIS: Relevant items and scales

        loop SCREENING (per item)
            Screening-->>User: Ask next question
            User->>Screening: Answer
            Screening->>Safety: Check for crisis signals
            
            alt Crisis mid-screening
                Safety-->>User: Crisis resources shown
            else No crisis
                Screening->>Screening: Extract scores and completion state
            end
        end

        AURIS->>Snapshot: Generate SOAP summary (SNAPSHOT)
        Snapshot-->>User: Summary with scores and recommendations
    end